# Weekly package upgrade sweep (Monday 05:10): machine-setup.sh
# upgrade-report runs brew update/upgrade/upgrade --cask/cleanup + mas
# upgrade and emails what got upgraded, what failed, and what is still
# outdated. Quiet no-op when nothing is outdated. This job only exits 1
# when that email could not be delivered, so the failure notification
# (banner + ntfy push) covers a lost report.
# Monday 05:10 by operator ruling 2026-10-08: after profile-autocapture
# (04:50), so no two brew runs share the lock. It is the one run that
# upgrades any package or app, captures the AI-app inventory, and checks
# TCC grants (sd:3062).
JOB_SCHEDULE="10 5 * * 1"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-machine-setup/machine-setup.sh\" upgrade-report"
# 13h: brew upgrade and the deferred source-build install are bounded
# at 6h each (system sd:7103; terra measured 3h of builds 2026-11-01).
JOB_TIMEOUT=13h
